{"id":"af068cd3cee16486","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-posner-epstein.md","title":"全部黑白需求迫使路径非可计算","display":"lem-posner-epstein — 全部黑白需求迫使路径非可计算","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-posner-epstein","aliases":["20-lem-posner-epstein"],"display":"lem-posner-epstein — 全部黑白需求迫使路径非可计算","chapter":"12","section":"12.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Lemma 12.2.1（Posner–Epstein）","source_printed_pages":[199],"source_pdf_pages":[229],"depends_on":["[[20-df-e-splitting]]","[[20-df-on-function-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-posner-epstein"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-posner-epstein</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-posner-epstein — 全部黑白需求迫使路径非可计算"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Lemma 12.2.1（Posner–Epstein）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>199</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>229</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" href=\"?note=5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" title=\"20-df-e-splitting\">20-df-e-splitting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"37dcefa1c874faab\" href=\"?note=37dcefa1c874faab\" title=\"20-df-on-function-tree\">20-df-on-function-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，存在全可计算函数树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{On}(A,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{On}(A,T)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EBlack}(T,e)\\lor\\operatorname{EWhite}(T,e)\">\\(\\operatorname{EBlack}(T,e)\\lor\\operatorname{EWhite}(T,e)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" href=\"?note=5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" title=\"20-df-e-splitting\">20-df-e-splitting</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"37dcefa1c874faab\" href=\"?note=37dcefa1c874faab\" title=\"20-df-on-function-tree\">20-df-on-function-tree</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}posner-epstein}\\vdash\nA\\not\\le_T\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}posner-epstein}\\vdash\nA\\not\\le_T\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算，编译泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi^X\">\\(\\Psi^X\\)</span>：先搜索 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的首个不同位，找到后输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X(x)\">\\(X(x)\\)</span>；未找到则发散。该泛函在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的每个有限前缀上处处发散，在不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的路径上为恒等输出。任何含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的全函数树都不能白：沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的某个子值没有停止输出，不能参加白分裂。也不能黑：先选择一条离开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的分支，再在它下面选两不相容分支，有限见证产生两个不同恒等输出。对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span> 的需求因此无法满足，矛盾。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 12.2.1（Posner–Epstein）；印刷页 199；PDF 第 229 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-e-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-e-splitting]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-on-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"37dcefa1c874faab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-on-function-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-e-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-splitting]]；see [[20-df-on-function-tree]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-on-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"37dcefa1c874faab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-splitting]]；see [[20-df-on-function-tree]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{On}(A,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EBlack}(T,e)\\lor\\operatorname{EWhite}(T,e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}posner-epstein}\\vdash\nA\\not\\le_T\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi^X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"X(x)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi","display":false}],"bytes":1585,"backlinks":[{"id":"42322b2e4562a7f4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal]]；see [[20-lem-black-tree]]；see [[20-lem-white-tree]]；see [[20-lem-posner-epstein]]。"}],"outgoing":["5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","37dcefa1c874faab"]}